Because it very much looks to me like on every freeze-up it's because the pathfinding system is having to make a TON of calls to the Lua system as a result of:
```
public float MovementCost
{
get
{
return (float) LuaUtilities.CallFunction(Type.MovementCostLua, this).Number;
}
}
