Next thing i will try is to use the approach of the link https://stackoverflow.com/questions/44014883/creating-txt-file-on-hololens from MD-V
If someone else has another idea i would be realy happy about to hear it
@zxzkf1992 it would be gread if you could post your directorys
Thanks again for the support
