No problem, glad to help. It's fine to open a new issue. It helps users search when they have a similar problem.
You want to make the simulator camera snap to the camera sensor position?
If so, you need to change simulator code.
- Add a new camera mode called Sensor
- Make it default on start. Follow is set now
- When mode is set, grab the agent and getcomponentinchildren of type Camera (hopefully it's one or you could grab an array)
- You could parent the camera to the other camera (smoothest view) or set pos/rotation every update (simple but could be jerky)
- Add an input that toggles through cameras
This is a great idea and we might implement something like this. Thanks for the post.
